-- 1366: Blog post -- "PPC Campaign Optimization with AI: Spending Less to Get the Same Leads".
-- Focus: AI where it moves PPC ROI -- ad variants at volume, negative-keyword mining, Quality
-- Score diagnosis, and reading performance often enough to act; structure stays human.
-- Funnels to WSQ Pay Per Click (PPC) Campaign Optimization: Driving ROI with Google Ads (TGS-2021009337), SG-only.
-- Published live (status=1), BACK-DATED to 2025-08-25 per the admin's "date all the digital
-- marketing blogs in Apr to Aug 2025" (post 16 of 16, WSQ/CASL digital marketing batch).
--
